## What a 3 Carat Asscher Cut Diamond Ring Actually Costs in {{year}}

The 3ct tier is where lab and natural pricing diverges most sharply.

Lab diamonds give you the full 3ct face-up — the same 8mm square outline — at a fraction of the natural price. Certified natural asschers at 3ct are rare and expensive. Here is the current certified market snapshot:

