| [IGI Lab Asscher](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28929787?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | 3.09ct | D | IF | [$9,102](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28929787?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) |

**What this means:** For $253 more, the 3.09ct gives you a fractionally larger stone — 3.09ct vs exactly 3.00ct. Both measure 8mm face-up. The difference on the finger is not visible. If the precise 3ct+ certificate matters to you, pay the $253. If it does not, both are equivalent purchases.

