## The Total Ring Number: 3ct Asscher Complete Ring Prices

**The Total Ring Number** is stone plus setting. Know it before you start.

At 3ct, the stone dominates the cost. A [$1,190 setting](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/art-deco-inspired-fleur-de-lis-pave-vintage-style-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-315298?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) on an [$8,849](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/26682894?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) stone is 13% of the total.

A [$1,190 setting](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/art-deco-inspired-fleur-de-lis-pave-vintage-style-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-315298?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) on a [$36,991](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28507345?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) stone is 3%. The setting matters — but the stone decides the budget tier.

